				)
				(justify left)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Single Schmitt-trigger buffer with voltage-level translator, TSSOP5 (SOT353-1), marking code 57. VCC 2.3-3.6 V; the input switching levels accept 1.8 V LVCMOS while the part runs from 2.5 V or 3.3 V, so it reads a lower-voltage target and re-drives at VCC. Inputs accept up to 3.6 V regardless of VCC. Fully specified for partial power-down: the IOFF circuitry blocks backflow current when VCC = 0, which is what makes it safe on a signal that crosses into a rail that can be switched off. Pin 1 is not connected internally."
			(at 241.3 80.01 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
